      "summary": "SCS-003 Booking MVP (Issue #57, ADR-0014): the third Class A Business System of the Application Factory at Level 0. Owns tenant-scoped Resources, their Availability Windows and Reservations behind the same enforcement chain as SCS-001/SCS-002, reuses IS-001 (tenant context), IS-003 (decision), IS-005 (exactly-once commands) and the audit semantics, and proves the no-double-booking invariant atomically under concurrency. Live operations: seven — create and read one owned Resource, declare and list its Availability Windows, create, read and cancel one Reservation.",
